          "date": "2026-11-26 13:39:21.000000000",
          "tz": 0
        },
        "subject": "LU-21345 utils: report LSOM sync result in llsom_sync",
        "message": "LU-21345 utils: report LSOM sync result in llsom_sync\n\nIn one-shot mode llsom_sync does not say whether any LSOM data were\nrefreshed. If the MDT changelog GC force-deregisters the changelog\nuser, the changelog is turned off and emptied, so there is no record\nto read, sync nothing and exit 0. The LSOM data stay stale.\n\nPrint a warn when nothing was synced. In sanity 807a, check with\nchangelog_user_rec() that the changelog user is still registered\nbefore and after llsom_sync, so that the failure reports the real\nreason instead of \"expected blocks: 2048, got: 0\".\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Hongchao Zhang <hongchao@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: DeepSeek:V4.1-Flash-1017 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: Iebf7b9fb00ecfdb75c656a752aa93db62380bf9e\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
